{
  "slug": "db-migration-guard",
  "name": "Db Migration Guard",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Database migration safety plugin that detects dangerous schema changes, warns about locking risks, and suggests zero-downtime migration patterns across Rails, Django, Laravel, and Prisma",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent**, **1 command** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `migrate-check` (This skill should be used when the user creates or edits a database migration, mentions \"migration safety\", \"schema…)\n- **Agents** (1): `migration-reviewer` (Deep migration analysis agent that reviews database migrations for safety, performance, and correctness)\n- **Commands** (1): `migrate-check` (Scan pending database migrations for safety risks and suggest improvements)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install db-migration-guard@claude-community` from `a-abdellatif98/db-migration-guard`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
